control: A configuration file's keys are matched exactly against the declaration
removes: the file's keys are lower-cased before the strict decode, so a case-changed key sets the value it resembles
packages: ./settings
tests: TestEveryMistakeIsRefusedAtStart/a_case-changed_key
scheduled-count: no

